 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "Conditional of **avere** or **essere** + participle: **avrei mangiato** (I would have eaten), **sarei andato** (I would have gone). The auxiliary usually follows the one the main verb takes in compound tenses: **sarei partito**, **avrei telefonato**.",
      "With **dovere, potere, volere** the variation is kept: **avrei dovuto partire** and **sarei dovuto partire** are both possible; it depends on the auxiliary of the infinitive."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Avrei dovuto, avrei potuto, avrei voluto",
     "texto": [
      "With modal verbs: **avrei dovuto** (I should have), **avrei potuto** (I could have), **avrei voluto** (I would have wanted).",
      "Example: **Avrei dovuto studiare** (I should have studied)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Form",
